{"id":394,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"少人数共学で未来力を育てる富士見丘","feature_description":"横浜富士見丘学園は、2019年度から男女共学化し、少人数と男女別のクラス編成を活かして新しい教育を進める学校です。中学では英語力、理数教育、生きる力を重視し、高校でも四つの特徴を軸に、時代の変化に応える学びを整えています。クラブ活動も放課後に活発です。学校紹介や行事の場でも生徒発信の動きが見えます。学園の伝統と変化を両立させています。","clubs":[{"id":7379,"name":"バドミントン","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fujimigaoka.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7380,"name":"ソフトテニス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fujimigaoka.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7381,"name":"ダンス(女子)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fujimigaoka.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7382,"name":"チアリーディング","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fujimigaoka.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7383,"name":"剣道","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fujimigaoka.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7384,"name":"フットサル(男子)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fujimigaoka.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7385,"name":"バスケットボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fujimigaoka.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7386,"name":"卓球(同好会)","category":"同好会・愛好会","source_url":"https://fujimigaoka.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7387,"name":"ソフトボール(同好会)","category":"同好会・愛好会","source_url":"https://fujimigaoka.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7388,"name":"バレーボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fujimigaoka.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7389,"name":"科学","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://fujimigaoka.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7390,"name":"軽音楽","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://fujimigaoka.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7391,"name":"家庭科","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://fujimigaoka.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7392,"name":"茶道・華道","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://fujimigaoka.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7393,"name